If you like games that destroy you from the inside with their extremely emotional stories, this is a good game for you!
THERE IS NO BRAKE ON THE FEEL TRAIN ! CHOUUUW CHOUW!
The game consists of making choices that will impact throughout the game in relation to the mystery surrounding Chloe, Max and the storm. But no matter what choices you make, your heart will eventually be broken in any way.
Pros
+ Lovable Characters;
+ Easy Achievements (You only need to take pictures);
+ There is always a way out of our bad choices;
+ The story is stunning and escalate well;
+ Melancholic soundtrack that fit perfectly;
+ You can fall in love with Chloe, if you make the choices for it, for me it's a open mind game developpement.
Cons
- Sometimes there are cliches;
- There is no perfect ending where everything ends good, there is always something you loss.
So, I give the score of 9/10
I hope this review will help you ^^

